  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-01-02T15:27:13.756Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is sort of streamer request. We want keep avatar visible many as possible for streaming reasons. Also between world loadings, especially big worlds, it can take minutes and we cannot interact with viewers because avatar is invisible.\nIt should more nice if it can stay visible (using last used avatar from cache) while loading. If there is no cache data found, default robot avatar can used as fallback.\n\nThis is also very useful for deaf / mute streamers. They cannot use voice for some reasons, and cannot use signs to interact with viewers without visible hands from avatar. And that is just not great to wait in silence until world is loaded.\n\nI know it makes load part slight heavier, but it's better than nothing, right? At least we have something visible to interact with others. There is already tracking data because the pointer use in loading world.\n\nThank you.",
